{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JH0HueE1hN1794868902.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國際能源署預期，全球原油供應將於第四季增加每日170萬桶，扭轉之前的減少預測，加上俄羅斯原油產量增加，原油期貨價格跌超過百分之3。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報85.72美元一桶，跌2.84美元，跌幅百分之3.2。倫敦期油收市報92.44美元一桶，跌3.4美元，跌幅百分之3.5。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T23:45:14.197226+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T22:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T00:59:02.714161+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T23:38:23.983761+00:00","content_hash":"4f7bca56775cda43c2e4c3dc8f1d39b407f6018b821906e4d3f81a393968eb5e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}